WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.000
[English subtitles are available]

01:29.810 --> 01:31.180
[My Journey to You]

01:31.200 --> 01:34.120
[Episode 18]

01:35.150 --> 01:36.410
Since Yun Que is dead,

01:37.620 --> 01:39.880
then how did Dian Zhu manage to detoxify?

01:40.900 --> 01:41.830
I guess

01:43.440 --> 01:45.170
when Yun Que left her pill bottle behind,

01:45.170 --> 01:46.430
it was just a cover-up.

01:47.410 --> 01:50.140
She has already hidden the Herb Elixir on herself

01:52.350 --> 01:54.750
and brought it back to Wufeng on the corpse.

01:57.470 --> 01:58.500
Maybe...

01:58.820 --> 02:01.190
Dian Zhu found the antidote elsewhere.

02:03.460 --> 02:05.120
But we won't be able to find out

02:06.340 --> 02:07.960
the truth now.

02:10.880 --> 02:12.680
Dian Zhu got lucky to be able to

02:13.540 --> 02:14.600
get away with this.

02:16.230 --> 02:16.820
So...

02:18.820 --> 02:20.460
If you can help me revenge

02:21.230 --> 02:22.230
and kill Dian Zhu,

02:24.260 --> 02:26.190
I'm willing to give up everything.

02:28.670 --> 02:29.400
Everything?

02:32.240 --> 02:32.620
Yes.

02:33.420 --> 02:34.150
Everything.

02:40.329 --> 02:41.530
What else do you have?

03:03.830 --> 03:05.630
You indeed took the Herb Elixir.

03:25.260 --> 03:25.790
Yuanzhi?

03:27.530 --> 03:28.050
Let go!

03:28.810 --> 03:29.670
Lowly servant!

03:29.670 --> 03:30.220
Let go of me!

03:30.220 --> 03:31.140
What are you doing?

03:31.140 --> 03:31.750
Jin Fan?

03:31.980 --> 03:32.890
What are you doing?

03:32.890 --> 03:34.940
Yuanzhi was eavesdropping on the tree.

03:34.940 --> 03:37.700
He said he's going to report Elder Yue and Yun Weishan for colludiong.

03:37.700 --> 03:38.790
The Sword Wielder just passed

03:38.790 --> 03:39.790
the second trial.

03:40.340 --> 03:42.400
I'm afraid it might affect you so I...

03:47.700 --> 03:49.030
Young Master Shangjue.

03:49.670 --> 03:51.900
Brother!

03:57.300 --> 03:57.970
Move!

04:10.990 --> 04:11.990
What should we do?

04:13.490 --> 04:14.670
Hide him first.

04:15.950 --> 04:16.940
If he makes any move,

04:16.940 --> 04:18.589
it will be exposed immediately.

04:18.589 --> 04:19.230
Elder Yue,

04:20.070 --> 04:21.600
do you have any medicine that can make one fall asleep?

04:21.600 --> 04:22.380
Give him some.

04:22.380 --> 04:23.980
Who would carry that around?

04:24.100 --> 04:25.500
Do you know acupuncture?

04:26.180 --> 04:27.710
I only know medicine and sword skills.

04:27.710 --> 04:29.110
I don't know acupunture.

05:07.900 --> 05:09.300
Where is Yuanzhi?

05:10.500 --> 05:11.340
Aren't you

05:11.660 --> 05:14.010
and Yuanzhi always together?

05:14.430 --> 05:16.240
Why are you looking for him at the Yu Lineage?

05:16.240 --> 05:17.430
Isn't this strange?

05:19.390 --> 05:21.590
I heard a whistling arrow from Yuanzhi.

05:22.030 --> 05:23.710
He must be in danger.

05:25.820 --> 05:26.950
The whistling arrow

05:28.740 --> 05:29.780
came from here.

05:30.980 --> 05:31.550
Really?

05:32.350 --> 05:33.280
Take a look then.

05:33.400 --> 05:34.030
Is he here?

05:48.210 --> 05:49.590
Why is Elder Yue here?

05:51.610 --> 05:54.320
When the Sword Wielder was practicing the Three Forms of Moon Slash,

05:54.320 --> 05:55.600
he had some questions

05:56.420 --> 05:57.880
and sent someone to ask me.

05:58.230 --> 06:00.160
I thought it was hard to explain in words,

06:00.160 --> 06:01.550
so I came here directly.

06:28.580 --> 06:29.840
If the whistling arrow

06:30.260 --> 06:32.460
really means that Yuanzhi is in danger,

06:32.909 --> 06:35.530
I suggest you go out and continue your search for him.

06:35.530 --> 06:36.460
If you need help,

06:36.820 --> 06:39.150
I can ask the guards in the lineage to help.

06:42.550 --> 06:44.680
I heard screams from outside just now.

06:45.370 --> 06:46.560
Are my servants

06:47.510 --> 06:48.310
all injured?

06:49.990 --> 06:51.390
I wonder who beat them up.

07:35.700 --> 07:36.770
Blood...

07:54.790 --> 07:57.000
[Gong]

08:02.100 --> 08:04.160
Release his acupoints immediately.

08:06.810 --> 08:08.110
I'll count to three.

08:09.680 --> 08:12.180
If Gong Yuanzhi doesn't stand up,

08:14.580 --> 08:15.570
I promise,

08:16.970 --> 08:18.400
before dawn,

08:21.110 --> 08:24.660
there won't be a complete brick left in the Yu Lineage.

08:26.780 --> 08:27.710
One.

08:30.940 --> 08:31.800
Two.

08:34.049 --> 08:34.850
Miss Yun.

08:55.520 --> 08:56.150
Stop.

09:00.850 --> 09:01.780
Yun Weishan.

09:03.290 --> 09:04.570
What you used just now

09:05.540 --> 09:08.340
is the Qingfeng Wenye Move from the Qingfeng Sect.

09:10.220 --> 09:13.040
When the Qingfeng Sect surrendered to Wufeng,

09:14.130 --> 09:18.060
they have already surrendered their martial arts mental techniques.

09:19.300 --> 09:21.480
You're indeed someone from Wufeng.

09:27.260 --> 09:28.120
Yuanzhi,

09:29.740 --> 09:30.490
are you okay?

09:32.300 --> 09:34.630
I haven't been this excited in a long time.

09:36.150 --> 09:37.610
Do you know your place now?

09:38.390 --> 09:39.190
Brother.

09:39.510 --> 09:41.040
Give your orders.

09:42.380 --> 09:43.510
Arrest Yun Weishan.

09:43.690 --> 09:45.290
If anyone dares to stop me...

09:45.430 --> 09:46.690
Other than Gong Ziyu,

09:47.910 --> 09:49.020
kill everyone

09:51.690 --> 09:52.990
right here.

11:08.150 --> 11:10.630
Using the Three Forms of Snow Saber in front of me?

11:10.630 --> 11:12.290
You overestimated yourself.

11:16.580 --> 11:17.840
[First Form: New Snow]

11:26.870 --> 11:28.890
Do you know your Snowmelt Heart Sutra

11:28.890 --> 11:30.990
doesn’t suit the Three Forms of Snow Saber?

11:30.990 --> 11:31.850
Sword Wielder.

11:31.990 --> 11:34.870
Gong Shangjue's inner cultivation technique is the Bitter Winter Three River Sutra

11:34.870 --> 11:37.940
It's the inner cultivation that suits the Three Forms of Snow Saber the best.

11:37.940 --> 11:39.930
You can't defeat him with it.

11:50.020 --> 11:51.450
Take Miss Yun with you first.

11:51.450 --> 11:52.450
You want to leave?

11:58.630 --> 11:59.130
Go!

11:59.430 --> 12:01.560
Go to the back hill to find Xue Chongzi.

12:05.710 --> 12:06.640
Come look for me.

12:06.670 --> 12:07.670
I'll wait for you!

12:37.560 --> 12:38.420
I didn't expect

12:40.010 --> 12:41.440
this bay flower ink

12:42.340 --> 12:44.280
can really calm people down.

12:47.870 --> 12:48.710
In the future,

12:49.630 --> 12:52.090
I'll grind ink and accompany you often then.

12:54.170 --> 12:55.030
In this life,

12:56.100 --> 12:57.900
I will stay by your side forever.

13:15.640 --> 13:17.700
Wufeng only trained us how to fight.

13:18.540 --> 13:19.870
But they never taught us

13:20.810 --> 13:21.870
how to fall in love.

13:24.990 --> 13:25.990
If a spy

13:27.210 --> 13:28.940
falls in love with her target,

13:30.380 --> 13:32.190
the consequences will be dire.

13:34.730 --> 13:35.870
Don't fall in love.

13:37.340 --> 13:38.700
This is my advice to you.

14:20.040 --> 14:21.100
I'm here to see you.

14:47.350 --> 14:48.350
Are you poisoned?

14:48.440 --> 14:49.440
What poison is it?

14:50.650 --> 14:52.380
Gong Yuanzhi's hidden weapon.

14:55.350 --> 14:57.210
Such disgrace to the Gong family!

14:57.650 --> 14:58.710
As a Sword Wielder,

14:59.140 --> 15:00.770
he was bewitched by beauty

15:01.470 --> 15:03.200
and colluded with a Wufeng spy,

15:03.360 --> 15:05.540
causing harm to the clan and his family.

15:05.540 --> 15:08.000
This is indeed a disgrace to the Gong family,

15:08.150 --> 15:09.740
and also a disaster.

15:09.850 --> 15:11.710
You're still twisting the truth!

15:13.340 --> 15:14.530
Narrow-minded,

15:14.870 --> 15:15.690
jealous,

15:15.980 --> 15:16.840
subjective,

15:16.930 --> 15:18.390
and framing the innocent.

15:18.710 --> 15:20.230
You even met me with a knife.

15:20.230 --> 15:21.610
I think you are the one who brings shame to the Gong family.

15:21.610 --> 15:22.070
Enough!

15:23.130 --> 15:23.750
Elder Yue.

15:24.780 --> 15:26.110
Although you are young,

15:26.490 --> 15:28.000
you're still an Elder.

15:29.300 --> 15:30.310
You should think carefully

15:30.310 --> 15:31.230
and take the overall situation into consideration.

15:31.230 --> 15:32.640
How can you mess around

15:32.830 --> 15:34.160
with a bunch of juniors?

15:35.220 --> 15:36.000
Shangjue.

15:37.070 --> 15:39.050
You've always been calm.

15:39.740 --> 15:40.410
But

15:40.870 --> 15:42.560
you broke into the Yu Lineage

15:42.790 --> 15:44.030
in the middle of the night with weapons

15:44.030 --> 15:46.950
and hurt dozens of guards, stabbing the Sword Wielder.

15:46.950 --> 15:48.000
No matter what,

15:48.100 --> 15:49.900
you have to give an explanation.

15:50.520 --> 15:51.320
Otherwise...

15:52.850 --> 15:53.780
Of course I will.

15:55.290 --> 15:56.730
When I was in the Jue Lineage,

15:56.730 --> 15:58.180
I heard a whistling arrow from Zhiyuan

15:58.180 --> 15:59.340
asking for help

15:59.990 --> 16:01.990
and went to Yu Lineage immediately.

16:02.110 --> 16:03.390
I found my brother

16:03.390 --> 16:04.790
already injured by them.

16:05.240 --> 16:06.080
After he was hit on his acupoint,

16:06.080 --> 16:07.660
he was hidden in a wooden cabinet.

16:07.660 --> 16:08.860
I wanted to save them

16:09.550 --> 16:12.010
but Gong Ziyu and the others tried to stop me.

16:12.150 --> 16:13.280
I had no choice but to

16:13.670 --> 16:15.270
take out my weapons to fight.

16:16.350 --> 16:17.210
Sword Wielder,

16:17.780 --> 16:18.850
why did you

16:18.880 --> 16:20.070
capture Mr. Jin?

16:20.700 --> 16:22.190
Because I saw Elder Yue

16:22.340 --> 16:23.580
and Wufeng spy

16:23.580 --> 16:25.470
Yun Weishan colluding.

16:26.350 --> 16:27.610
They wanted to kill me.

16:28.870 --> 16:29.780
Elder Yue?

16:30.600 --> 16:32.060
I suspect that Yun Weishan

16:32.510 --> 16:33.660
is a Wufeng spy.

16:34.880 --> 16:35.540
Therefore,

16:36.310 --> 16:37.510
I went to the back hill

16:37.680 --> 16:39.800
to bring her back for interrogation.

16:42.000 --> 16:43.400
But Elder Yue stopped me.

16:45.010 --> 16:46.250
His reason was

16:47.490 --> 16:48.930
he made a new drug

16:49.440 --> 16:50.570
called Truth Grass.

16:51.480 --> 16:52.540
Anyone who takes it

16:52.990 --> 16:54.190
will say everything,

16:54.420 --> 16:56.370
and everything they say will be true.

16:56.370 --> 16:57.430
I trusted Elder Yue

16:57.740 --> 16:59.340
and did not doubt him one bit.

16:59.350 --> 17:00.740
However, Yuanzhi happened to chance upon

17:00.740 --> 17:02.380
them plotting.

17:02.930 --> 17:05.930
This is Young Master Shangjue's subjective opinion.

17:06.430 --> 17:08.550
I was born in the back hill of the Gong family.

17:08.550 --> 17:09.950
I grew up in the back hill.

17:10.280 --> 17:12.010
I was devoted to medical skills

17:12.170 --> 17:13.390
and never left the hill.

17:13.390 --> 17:15.170
I have no reason nor chance

17:15.420 --> 17:16.750
to collude with Wufeng.

17:17.040 --> 17:19.839
I have no intention to harm the Gong family either.

17:20.109 --> 17:21.200
Then please

17:21.410 --> 17:24.670
hand over the Truth Grass used to interrogate Yun Weishan.

17:24.859 --> 17:26.060
We'll know if it works

17:26.619 --> 17:27.650
once we try it.

17:28.830 --> 17:30.780
Yuanzhi is also good at herbs.

17:31.490 --> 17:32.670
He can help the elders

17:32.670 --> 17:33.800
verify if it's real.

17:33.870 --> 17:35.880
It's difficult to produce Truth Grass.

17:35.880 --> 17:37.650
The herbs it uses are very rare.

17:39.040 --> 17:40.250
All the Truth Grass

17:40.650 --> 17:42.110
have been used on Miss Yun.

17:43.010 --> 17:45.210
I don't have anymore for the time being.

17:46.810 --> 17:47.460
Elders,

17:48.950 --> 17:51.010
Young Master Shangjue has been in the martial world for years

17:51.010 --> 17:52.940
so he is good at defending himself.

17:53.990 --> 17:55.100
But as he said,

17:55.550 --> 17:57.080
he heard a whistling arrow.

17:57.900 --> 18:00.650
But the Jue Lineage is far away from the Yu Lineage.

18:00.650 --> 18:01.300
At most,

18:01.320 --> 18:03.990
he can only tell which direction the arrow was shot from.

18:03.990 --> 18:05.060
In this direction,

18:05.630 --> 18:08.090
there is also Shang Lineage and Zhi Lineage.

18:08.510 --> 18:09.490
How were you so sure

18:09.490 --> 18:10.950
that Young Master Zhiyuan

18:11.030 --> 18:11.780
must've been

18:11.990 --> 18:13.130
in the Yu Lineage?

18:16.820 --> 18:18.530
Young Master Shangjue disregarded everything

18:18.530 --> 18:20.060
and injured all the guards at the Yu Lineage,

18:20.060 --> 18:21.920
rushing in to demand for Yuanzhi.

18:22.270 --> 18:23.730
This is either conspiracy

18:24.070 --> 18:27.400
or a malicious plot that they have been plotting up for long.

18:29.790 --> 18:30.230
Also,

18:31.150 --> 18:32.560
Yuanzhi just said

18:33.610 --> 18:34.300
Elder Yue

18:34.810 --> 18:36.530
conspired with Miss Yun.

18:37.390 --> 18:38.390
I would like to ask

18:39.430 --> 18:40.830
what exactly did you see?

18:41.970 --> 18:44.230
You're still trying to defend yourself.

18:44.720 --> 18:45.710
I was hiding on the roof

18:45.710 --> 18:47.620
across from Yun Weishan's room,

18:48.040 --> 18:49.090
looking down from a vantage point.

18:49.090 --> 18:50.890
I could see everything clearly.

18:51.020 --> 18:53.420
After Elder Yue came out from the back hill,

18:53.670 --> 18:54.660
he climbed over the wall

18:54.660 --> 18:56.700
and went straight into Yun Weishan's room.

18:56.700 --> 18:58.690
In order to make sure people don't find out,

18:58.690 --> 19:00.710
he drugged the guards with incense.

19:01.710 --> 19:03.570
I was going to report to my brother

19:03.900 --> 19:05.220
but Jin Fan found me

19:05.460 --> 19:06.320
and stopped me,

19:08.670 --> 19:09.570
injuring me,

19:09.800 --> 19:13.200
and trapped me in the Yu Lineage after attacking my acupoint.

19:14.660 --> 19:16.170
You mean

19:16.550 --> 19:18.350
Elder Yue went straight into

19:18.620 --> 19:20.540
Yun Weishan's room after leaving the back hill?

19:20.540 --> 19:21.340
That's right.

19:21.690 --> 19:22.910
You just said

19:23.330 --> 19:24.130
Elder Yue

19:24.340 --> 19:26.270
drugged the guards with incense.

19:26.940 --> 19:27.760
May I ask

19:28.370 --> 19:30.430
when did he put the knockout incense?

19:34.780 --> 19:37.110
But there was knockout incense in the air.

19:37.110 --> 19:37.570
Also,

19:38.830 --> 19:41.360
why were my guards in Yu Lineage unconscious,

19:41.460 --> 19:42.210
but not

19:42.280 --> 19:43.540
Young Master Yuanzhi?

19:43.580 --> 19:44.310
Ridiculous.

19:44.900 --> 19:46.270
I've been taking Herb Elixir for a long time.

19:46.270 --> 19:48.670
A little knockout incense is nothing to me.

19:50.320 --> 19:51.450
Here's the problem.

19:51.980 --> 19:52.910
You said

19:53.030 --> 19:54.290
Jin Fan fought with you

19:54.380 --> 19:55.310
and stopped you.

19:55.760 --> 19:57.560
If there was a knockout incense,

19:57.630 --> 19:59.430
why wasn't Jin Fan unconscious?

20:00.070 --> 20:01.730
He's just a Green Jade Guardian.

20:01.730 --> 20:03.990
Could he also have taken the Herb Elixir?

20:04.100 --> 20:05.160
One last question.

20:06.710 --> 20:08.050
Why were you

20:08.220 --> 20:10.340
hiding at the top of Yu Lineage's roof in the middle of the night?

20:10.340 --> 20:11.620
What were you trying to do?

20:11.620 --> 20:12.040
I...

20:12.670 --> 20:13.400
I was just...

20:16.920 --> 20:17.450
Brother.

20:20.970 --> 20:23.830
I had some questions regarding Three Forms of Moon Slash while I was practicing it

20:23.830 --> 20:24.900
so I sent someone to the back hill

20:24.900 --> 20:26.620
to ask Elder Yue to come and help me with it.

20:26.620 --> 20:28.480
Jin Fan was doing his night patrol

20:28.510 --> 20:29.390
and found someone suspicious

20:29.390 --> 20:30.630
on the roof.

20:31.030 --> 20:32.420
Young Master Yuanzhi found that he was discovered

20:32.420 --> 20:33.620
and could not excape,

20:33.980 --> 20:35.930
so he could only shoot a whistling arrow to inform Gong Shangjue.

20:35.930 --> 20:37.390
Meanwhile, Gong Shangjue

20:37.460 --> 20:39.040
already knew that Young Master yuanzhi

20:39.040 --> 20:40.380
was hiding in the Yu Lineage

20:40.380 --> 20:42.710
and rushed to the Yu Lineage to ask for him.

20:43.620 --> 20:45.340
The whole situation is very clear.

20:45.340 --> 20:47.350
But the two brothers, Gong Yuanzhi and Gong Shangjue

20:47.350 --> 20:48.640
are twisting the facts,

20:48.640 --> 20:49.960
making up these lies

20:49.980 --> 20:51.200
full of flaws.

20:53.570 --> 20:54.100
As for

20:55.040 --> 20:57.020
Elder Yue colluding with Yun Weishan,

20:57.020 --> 20:58.680
that is even more ridiculous.

20:59.350 --> 20:59.900
Miss Yun,

21:00.420 --> 21:02.500
wasn't even in the Yu Lineage yesterday.

21:02.500 --> 21:03.550
Gong Ziyu, you–

21:03.780 --> 21:04.290
Enough!

21:05.760 --> 21:06.740
No matter what,

21:07.370 --> 21:09.030
Gong Shangjue broke the rules

21:09.140 --> 21:10.480
by using his weapons.

21:10.990 --> 21:12.120
He must be punished.

21:13.020 --> 21:15.020
I was badly injured by Gong Ziyu too.

21:15.110 --> 21:16.070
My internal injury is severe.

21:16.070 --> 21:17.140
My mouth was covered in blood.

21:17.140 --> 21:18.340
The guards all saw it.

21:18.570 --> 21:20.830
Gong Yuanzhi is really making things up.

21:21.410 --> 21:24.660
You clearly saw that Gong Shangjue stabbed me with a sword.

21:24.660 --> 21:25.750
You didn't want the elders to blame you.

21:25.750 --> 21:27.770
That's why you bit your lips and mouth to spit blood

21:27.770 --> 21:28.490
to frame me.

21:30.350 --> 21:31.110
Elders,

21:31.780 --> 21:33.020
you can ask a physician

21:33.020 --> 21:34.080
to check his pulse.

21:35.140 --> 21:36.780
The injuries that Gong Yuanzhi

21:36.780 --> 21:39.890
had sustained were all external injuries on his lips and tongue.

21:39.890 --> 21:40.950
We will know easily

21:41.380 --> 21:42.780
who's telling the truth.

21:48.150 --> 21:48.880
It seems

21:49.970 --> 21:51.470
I've underestimated you.

21:52.710 --> 21:53.590
Ziyu,

21:54.830 --> 21:56.050
you're meticulous

21:56.780 --> 21:57.830
and adaptive.

21:58.540 --> 22:01.070
You're good at making up something that is flawless

22:01.070 --> 22:02.600
by capturing every detail.

22:03.000 --> 22:04.600
But black is black.

22:05.790 --> 22:07.790
No matter how glib-tongued you are,

22:08.540 --> 22:09.800
it can't become white.

22:11.650 --> 22:13.780
The questions you have asked just now,

22:13.940 --> 22:15.470
I can answer them one by one.

22:22.110 --> 22:23.820
After I came back from the back hill,

22:23.820 --> 22:26.750
I still haven't let go of my doubts about Yun Weishan.

22:27.300 --> 22:27.930
So,

22:28.820 --> 22:30.030
I told the elders about how

22:30.030 --> 22:31.970
she is able to withstand

22:32.930 --> 22:34.390
the Heart Devouring Moon.

22:35.640 --> 22:37.970
That's why I sent Yuanzhi to the Yu Lineage

22:38.500 --> 22:40.760
to monitor the movements of Yun Weishan.

22:41.940 --> 22:44.130
So when I heard the whistling arrow,

22:44.820 --> 22:45.750
I knew

22:46.500 --> 22:48.960
that I had to go look for him at the Yu Lineage.

22:51.380 --> 22:51.840
Second,

22:53.670 --> 22:55.510
whether Jin Fan took Herb Elixir

22:56.140 --> 22:57.070
is easy to prove.

22:57.970 --> 22:59.920
The wound on his arm

23:00.540 --> 23:02.800
was caused by a hidden weapon by Yuanzhi.

23:03.540 --> 23:05.010
As you all know,

23:05.620 --> 23:07.220
the hidden weapons of Yanzhi

23:07.510 --> 23:08.370
contain

23:08.520 --> 23:10.910
the lethal toxins of Throat-Constricting poison.

23:10.910 --> 23:12.040
Even if Guardian Jin

23:12.260 --> 23:13.140
is strong

23:14.630 --> 23:15.700
and gifted,

23:16.350 --> 23:18.210
and is able to resist the incense,

23:18.910 --> 23:21.460
but to be able to be completely unharmed

23:21.620 --> 23:23.180
in the face of Yuanzhi's poison,

23:23.180 --> 23:25.110
he must have taken the Herb Elixir.

23:27.860 --> 23:28.490
My injury

23:28.850 --> 23:30.150
was caused by Young Master Shangjue's sword

23:30.150 --> 23:31.410
when we were fighting.

23:35.030 --> 23:36.600
It's easy to identify if it's a wound caused by

23:36.600 --> 23:38.060
a sword or a hidden weapon.

23:38.640 --> 23:39.350
You don't have to

23:39.350 --> 23:41.430
to deny such a lowly accusation.

23:42.990 --> 23:43.660
Besides,

23:44.540 --> 23:46.310
if you still insist,

23:47.460 --> 23:48.830
let's have a bet.

23:49.710 --> 23:50.890
I'll ask Yuanzhi to

23:51.180 --> 23:53.180
injure you with a hidden weapon now.

23:53.470 --> 23:54.800
If you die of poisoning,

23:55.260 --> 23:56.460
I'll pay with my life.

23:57.230 --> 23:59.210
But if you are safe,

24:00.110 --> 24:02.100
then commit suicide right here.

24:03.340 --> 24:04.220
Do you dare?

24:12.820 --> 24:13.490
But

24:14.620 --> 24:16.550
how did Jin Fan get the Herb Elixir?

24:17.250 --> 24:18.050
Was it stolen,

24:18.590 --> 24:19.190
snatched,

24:19.790 --> 24:20.610
or

24:21.300 --> 24:22.500
is there another way?

24:23.400 --> 24:25.460
I'll leave it to the elders to decide.

24:25.860 --> 24:26.590
Originally,

24:27.140 --> 24:29.540
this was not the focus of today's conflict.

24:30.230 --> 24:32.430
But since Young Master Yu mentioned it,

24:32.770 --> 24:33.770
I shall refute it.

24:35.270 --> 24:37.770
As to whether the Truth Grass Elder Yue

24:37.860 --> 24:39.320
mentioned is real or fake,

24:39.870 --> 24:41.030
it's easy to verify.

24:42.100 --> 24:43.950
It doesn't matter if it's used up.

24:43.950 --> 24:46.010
You can write down the prescription.

24:46.030 --> 24:47.010
Yuanzhi

24:47.430 --> 24:49.090
is quite skilled in medicine.

24:49.580 --> 24:51.110
He can create it on the spot.

24:52.270 --> 24:53.800
If this grass really works,

24:54.410 --> 24:55.840
Yuanzhi and I

24:55.900 --> 24:56.820
will take it

24:57.350 --> 24:59.080
for the elders to interrogate.

25:03.550 --> 25:05.150
But if this medicine is fake,

25:06.260 --> 25:07.180
Elder Yue,

25:08.000 --> 25:09.110
you might have to be interrogated

25:09.110 --> 25:10.480
by Yuanzhi and I.

25:14.780 --> 25:17.180
I put my heart and soul into the Truth Grass.

25:17.870 --> 25:18.480
Asking me to

25:18.480 --> 25:21.140
give the prescription to Young Master Yuanzhi,

25:22.430 --> 25:24.030
I do feel reluctant about it.

25:24.620 --> 25:25.080
Yes.

25:25.810 --> 25:26.540
Gong Yuanzhi

25:27.030 --> 25:28.310
would be unwilling to give us the prescription of the poison

25:28.310 --> 25:29.910
and the antidote too, right?

25:31.230 --> 25:32.430
What Elder Yue has just said

25:32.430 --> 25:34.170
might have been a bit out of line.

25:34.170 --> 25:35.830
Elder Yue’s research results

25:36.300 --> 25:37.740
are Gong family's results.

25:37.740 --> 25:38.800
We should share it.

25:39.380 --> 25:41.150
What do you mean by it's a secret?

25:41.150 --> 25:41.990
Besides,

25:42.010 --> 25:43.880
Gong Yuanzhi's poison formula

25:44.150 --> 25:45.350
has full records kept

25:45.350 --> 25:46.750
at the Council of Elders.

25:47.300 --> 25:48.160
It's just that,

25:48.390 --> 25:50.650
there's no need to reveal it to everyone.

25:53.670 --> 25:54.470
That’s right!

25:55.490 --> 25:56.090
Elder Yue,

25:56.690 --> 25:59.820
please write down the prescription for the Truth Grass.

26:13.240 --> 26:14.820
After the weapon is launched,

26:14.820 --> 26:16.680
with the explosion and puncture,

26:17.740 --> 26:20.000
we can't see its original shape anymore.

26:25.070 --> 26:27.610
It's indeed a hidden weapon from Gong Yuanzhi.

26:27.610 --> 26:29.940
Wrap the fragments with parchment paper.

27:20.050 --> 27:20.970
Yuanzhi,

27:21.280 --> 27:22.880
please prepare the medicine

27:23.320 --> 27:24.850
and clear Elder Yue's name.

27:25.820 --> 27:27.550
If this medicine really works,

27:27.840 --> 27:29.430
I'll take it with Ziyu

27:29.790 --> 27:31.520
for the elders to interrogate.

27:33.260 --> 27:34.390
He did it on purpose.

27:36.450 --> 27:37.780
Thousand-Spirit Moxu,

27:37.820 --> 27:38.680
Buddha Citrus,

27:38.870 --> 27:40.930
and Four-Leaved Ghost Needle Grass.

27:40.990 --> 27:42.650
These are all rare materials.

27:43.380 --> 27:43.910
Brother.

27:44.350 --> 27:47.350
Buddha Citrus bear fruits only once every four years.

27:47.540 --> 27:49.180
There is only one Four-Leaved Ghost Needle Grass

27:49.180 --> 27:51.180
among ten thousand Ghost Needle Grass.

27:51.180 --> 27:51.720
Besides,

27:52.350 --> 27:53.150
these are all

27:53.190 --> 27:55.390
nonconventional herbs for antidotes.

27:56.150 --> 27:58.210
We don't have them in the storehouse.

28:00.190 --> 28:01.170
What's worse,

28:02.460 --> 28:04.390
the last herb he has written down is

28:07.860 --> 28:08.920
Chuyun Chonglian.

28:12.030 --> 28:14.580
That's why I said it's difficult to create the Truth Grass

28:14.580 --> 28:16.240
and it can't be mass produced.

28:19.070 --> 28:20.400
I didn't mean to hide it.

28:20.790 --> 28:21.430
It's okay.

28:22.690 --> 28:23.490
In this world,

28:24.340 --> 28:27.540
not only the Truth Grass can get people to speak the truth.

28:28.940 --> 28:30.120
Yuanzhi and I

28:30.820 --> 28:32.820
can also make people tell the truth.

28:40.140 --> 28:40.860
How is she?

28:42.330 --> 28:43.930
She has taken the Snow Lotus.

28:44.740 --> 28:46.940
She can hold on for two more days at most.

28:47.300 --> 28:48.500
Only Gong Yuanzhi can

28:49.340 --> 28:50.740
detoxify his own poison.

28:52.180 --> 28:53.370
What happened?

28:54.300 --> 28:56.360
Why did they fight with Gong Yuanzhi?

28:57.450 --> 28:58.350
What about the Sword Wielder?

28:58.350 --> 28:59.110
Was he hurt?

29:00.900 --> 29:01.780
I'm so worried.

29:03.210 --> 29:04.550
Should I go to the front hill?

29:04.550 --> 29:05.680
You're not an elder.

29:06.190 --> 29:07.850
You can't go to the front hill.

29:08.060 --> 29:09.380
This damn rule.

29:10.770 --> 29:12.300
Go get some more snow lotus.

29:12.740 --> 29:14.130
Get those from the Ice Pool.

29:14.130 --> 29:14.650
Okay.

29:14.800 --> 29:15.930
I'll pick a few more.

29:16.920 --> 29:17.680
Gong Ziyu,

29:18.200 --> 29:21.130
you'd better bring me more candied fruits next time.

29:30.850 --> 29:32.580
We've been arguing for so long.

29:32.740 --> 29:34.080
But we digressed.

29:34.990 --> 29:36.320
The core of our argument

29:36.500 --> 29:37.550
was Wufeng spy.

29:38.460 --> 29:39.460
It's Yun Weishan.

29:40.180 --> 29:42.440
She should be the one to be interrogated.

29:42.890 --> 29:43.640
But now,

29:44.190 --> 29:45.650
she is nowhere to be found.

29:46.630 --> 29:47.150
So,

29:47.870 --> 29:48.580
Ziyu,

29:49.310 --> 29:50.840
you'd better tell everyone

29:51.250 --> 29:52.450
where Yun Weishan is.

29:52.890 --> 29:53.750
Sword Wielder,

29:53.910 --> 29:55.570
do you know where the cloud is?

29:56.460 --> 29:57.610
Yun Weishan

29:58.030 --> 29:59.830
was injured by my hidden weapon,

29:59.900 --> 30:02.100
I'm afraid she won't survive tomorrow.

30:03.220 --> 30:03.790
So...

30:05.070 --> 30:05.870
Ziyu,

30:07.000 --> 30:08.910
you'd better tell us where she is.

30:09.940 --> 30:10.670
Don't worry.

30:11.040 --> 30:13.170
In order to properly interrogate her,

30:14.170 --> 30:16.010
I won't let her die.

30:19.250 --> 30:20.050
Yuanzhi,

30:21.160 --> 30:22.400
stop slandering me.

30:23.110 --> 30:23.980
After dinner,

30:24.270 --> 30:25.470
I've asked Yun Weishan

30:25.470 --> 30:28.510
to ask for some Tianshan Snow Lotus from Young Master Xue.

30:28.510 --> 30:29.370
At this moment,

30:29.730 --> 30:31.260
she is in the Xue Residence.

30:31.980 --> 30:33.980
Whether Yun Weishan is a Wufeng spy,

30:34.270 --> 30:35.320
we can find that out

30:35.320 --> 30:36.780
after the interrogation.

30:37.040 --> 30:37.630
When

30:37.990 --> 30:39.860
Shangguan Qian was suspected,

30:40.070 --> 30:40.760
she was also

30:41.300 --> 30:42.140
locked up and

30:42.690 --> 30:44.490
interrogated by me personally.

30:45.740 --> 30:47.540
I hope Ziyu can set an example

30:48.400 --> 30:49.670
and not be biased.

30:51.090 --> 30:53.150
If Yun Weishan is really a Wufeng spy,

30:53.990 --> 30:54.660
I hope

30:54.660 --> 30:56.030
you can realize it soon.

30:57.420 --> 30:58.700
But if Gong Ziyu

30:58.800 --> 31:00.570
breaks the rules despite knowing them

31:00.570 --> 31:02.440
and is seduced by the beauty of women,

31:02.440 --> 31:04.970
ignoring the safety of the whole Gong family,

31:05.310 --> 31:05.970
then he

31:06.180 --> 31:07.650
is not just a fool,

31:08.280 --> 31:10.650
but a sinner of the Gong family.

31:12.020 --> 31:12.620
Of course,

31:13.760 --> 31:15.020
I hope it's the former.

31:16.450 --> 31:17.160
Otherwise,

31:18.780 --> 31:19.470
this is the last time

31:19.470 --> 31:21.990
I will call you brother.

31:25.190 --> 31:26.910
Send six Yellow Jade Guardians

31:26.910 --> 31:28.460
to the back hill's Xue Lineage

31:28.460 --> 31:29.920
to bring Yun Weishan back.

31:30.350 --> 31:30.800
Elder.

31:31.590 --> 31:32.460
If Yun Weishan

31:32.520 --> 31:34.110
is really a Wufeng spy,

31:34.830 --> 31:37.160
I'm afraid the guards are no match for her.

31:37.260 --> 31:37.830
How about

31:38.190 --> 31:39.970
send Yuanzhi over together?

31:40.710 --> 31:41.840
I'll stay here

31:42.220 --> 31:44.080
to be interrogated by the elders.

31:44.470 --> 31:46.530
Yuanzhi is still underage.

31:47.330 --> 31:48.100
By right,

31:48.500 --> 31:49.740
he can't enter the back hill.

31:49.740 --> 31:52.180
There are already many rules of the Gong family

31:52.180 --> 31:53.710
that were broken this year.

31:55.960 --> 31:57.350
Under the order of the Elders

31:57.350 --> 31:59.680
to go ahead with the Yellow Jade Guardians

32:00.860 --> 32:02.540
seem reasonable enough.

32:04.190 --> 32:05.050
Just this once.

32:05.500 --> 32:06.030
Yuanzhi.

32:06.570 --> 32:07.770
Go and come back soon.

32:09.070 --> 32:09.990
I will go too.

32:12.030 --> 32:12.410
Okay.

32:13.500 --> 32:14.900
Go along, Sword Wielder.

32:15.460 --> 32:16.250
As a witness.

32:17.300 --> 32:18.140
Lest

32:18.540 --> 32:20.400
there are only what Yuanzhi says.

32:34.780 --> 32:35.790
I heard about it.

32:35.810 --> 32:36.630
What should we do now?

32:36.630 --> 32:37.470
I'm so anxious.

32:37.470 --> 32:38.920
I was about to look for you.

32:38.920 --> 32:40.560
Sword Wielder wants you to secretly enter the Elders Hall.

32:40.560 --> 32:42.510
What a heartless little thing!

32:42.530 --> 32:43.940
He wants to drag me into this?

32:43.940 --> 32:44.900
Keep your voice down.

32:44.900 --> 32:45.560
The Sword Wilder said

32:45.560 --> 32:46.630
when Miss Yun escaped,

32:46.630 --> 32:48.220
she did get injured by the hidden weapon.

32:48.220 --> 32:50.240
Even if she can make it to the Xue Lineage,

32:50.240 --> 32:51.770
the Tianshan Snow Lotus

32:52.010 --> 32:53.520
can only extend his life barely.

32:53.520 --> 32:54.510
To detoxify the poison,

32:54.510 --> 32:56.640
we must find Gong Yuanzhi's antidote.

32:57.660 --> 32:59.790
Then why should I go to the Elders Hall?

33:00.390 --> 33:02.260
Gong Yuanzhi's poison formula

33:02.700 --> 33:03.870
has complete records

33:03.870 --> 33:05.110
in the Elders Hall.

33:08.310 --> 33:09.130
Elder Xue,

33:09.190 --> 33:10.390
is really a good man.

33:10.530 --> 33:11.000
So...

33:11.200 --> 33:11.830
Miss Yun.

33:13.730 --> 33:15.190
The Sword Wielder's wife.

33:18.220 --> 33:19.480
Your sister-in-law's life

33:19.480 --> 33:20.340
depends on you.

33:20.660 --> 33:22.170
Even if I get the antidote,

33:22.340 --> 33:23.770
I can't go to the back hill.

33:23.770 --> 33:24.350
Don't worry.

33:24.350 --> 33:25.470
The Sword Wielder has made the necessary arrangements.

33:25.470 --> 33:26.390
Someone will come pick it up.

33:26.390 --> 33:28.120
Just wait in the Shang Lineage.

33:28.430 --> 33:29.030
All right.

33:38.720 --> 33:39.560
What?

33:39.980 --> 33:40.840
This matter

33:40.990 --> 33:42.390
has nothing to do with me.

33:43.150 --> 33:44.020
Yuanzhi.

33:44.390 --> 33:45.450
Tell your brother,

33:45.470 --> 33:47.070
I'm on no one's side for this.

33:48.220 --> 33:49.080
Tell Gong Ziyu,

33:49.620 --> 33:50.280
he and I

33:50.680 --> 33:51.560
are over now.

33:57.540 --> 33:58.740
What kind of person is she?

33:58.740 --> 33:59.600
What a traitor.

34:06.160 --> 34:09.409
[Xue Lineage]

34:43.250 --> 34:44.449
Where is Yun Weishan?

34:45.900 --> 34:46.699
Hand her over!

34:48.090 --> 34:48.949
Sword Wielder.

34:52.710 --> 34:54.030
I've sent Miss Yun

34:54.139 --> 34:56.400
to ask for some Tianshan Snow Lotus here.

34:56.989 --> 34:58.060
I wonder if you

34:58.530 --> 34:59.760
agreed?

35:00.820 --> 35:01.680
I did.

35:02.430 --> 35:04.550
I know it's the Sword Wielder's request

35:04.550 --> 35:05.860
so I asked Miss Yun

35:05.860 --> 35:07.180
to go pick the best snow lotus

35:07.180 --> 35:08.730
in the Ice Pond.

35:09.530 --> 35:11.870
The place where Snow Lotus grows is very dangerous.

35:11.870 --> 35:12.930
I wonder if Miss Yun

35:12.960 --> 35:13.840
will be safe

35:14.300 --> 35:15.350
picking them?

35:18.140 --> 35:18.960
Not for now.

35:20.010 --> 35:21.590
But as you said,

35:23.270 --> 35:24.470
it is very dangerous.

35:28.690 --> 35:29.660
Cut the crap.

35:30.390 --> 35:31.120
Lead the way.

35:31.650 --> 35:33.050
The road ahead is narrow.

35:33.400 --> 35:34.280
Come one by one.

36:08.810 --> 36:09.670
How is Miss Yun?

36:10.160 --> 36:12.890
She's poisoned by Gong Yuanzhi's hidden weapon.

36:14.360 --> 36:15.600
Look for Gong Zishang on the front hill.

36:15.600 --> 36:16.800
She has the antidote.

36:55.010 --> 36:56.430
Please step back.

36:56.960 --> 36:58.360
The Ice Pool is very cold.

36:58.530 --> 37:00.660
The moment it comes out might hurt you.

37:24.460 --> 37:25.260
Open the door!

37:25.900 --> 37:27.160
The Sword Wielder

37:27.310 --> 37:29.510
just took off the key to the secret room.

37:30.500 --> 37:31.790
To activate the secret room,

37:31.790 --> 37:32.790
we'd need that.

37:35.300 --> 37:36.720
Then make another one.

37:41.620 --> 37:42.060
Yun.

37:43.450 --> 37:44.510
Young Master Ziyu.

37:51.720 --> 37:52.780
Young Master Ziyu.

37:53.590 --> 37:55.590
I've been poisoned by Gong Yuanzhi.

37:56.780 --> 37:58.040
Without the antidote,

37:58.930 --> 38:00.460
I won't be able to live long.

38:02.250 --> 38:04.310
Take this opportunity to hand me over

38:05.420 --> 38:06.470
and tell everyone

38:07.220 --> 38:08.710
that I'm a Wufeng spy.

38:08.880 --> 38:09.430
No.

38:09.930 --> 38:10.790
I can't do that.

38:13.040 --> 38:13.920
Listen to me.

38:16.070 --> 38:17.770
You must hand me over

38:19.450 --> 38:22.050
to ensure your innocence as the Sword Wielder.

38:24.950 --> 38:25.580
Yun.

38:27.680 --> 38:30.210
I'll get the antidote from Gong Yuanzhi soon.

38:31.150 --> 38:33.350
Please bear with it a little more, okay?

38:36.420 --> 38:37.480
Young Master Ziyu.

38:38.560 --> 38:40.350
I don't want to be your burden.

38:41.300 --> 38:41.840
Yun,

38:44.090 --> 38:45.550
since the time I chose you,

38:47.030 --> 38:48.080
in my heart,

38:49.760 --> 38:51.320
you were already my bride.

38:53.420 --> 38:54.530
You can be Wufeng,

38:55.890 --> 38:56.460
or you can also be

38:56.460 --> 38:58.390
not the Yun Weishan from Lixi Town.

39:00.940 --> 39:02.090
But in my heart,

39:03.400 --> 39:04.400
you are Yun.

39:12.010 --> 39:13.670
I won't let anyone hurt you.

39:15.240 --> 39:16.120
Trust me.

39:21.230 --> 39:22.380
Why me?

39:28.040 --> 39:29.630
I told you at that time.

39:32.090 --> 39:32.700
Back then,

39:34.760 --> 39:36.820
I just wanted to find someone pretty.

39:39.400 --> 39:40.280
What about now?

39:46.670 --> 39:47.420
Now?

39:48.920 --> 39:50.580
I realized you're not pretty.

39:56.270 --> 39:57.300
I mean,

40:00.130 --> 40:01.460
you're not only pretty,

40:02.630 --> 40:03.770
but also kind.

40:05.300 --> 40:07.160
Everything you did was for my sake

40:08.050 --> 40:10.110
and helped me quietly behind my back.

40:11.480 --> 40:12.540
No matter what I do,

40:13.050 --> 40:14.750
you'd always be on my side.

40:18.830 --> 40:19.480
Anyway,

40:21.350 --> 40:22.310
in all aspects,

40:23.760 --> 40:24.750
you are very,

40:26.290 --> 40:27.190
very good.

40:31.580 --> 40:32.360
It's you.

40:46.560 --> 40:47.250
Yun,

40:50.970 --> 40:52.140
I'm your husband.

40:53.890 --> 40:55.100
I must protect you.

40:58.530 --> 40:59.060
But

41:06.430 --> 41:08.560
I'm also Gong family's Sword Wielder.

41:11.010 --> 41:13.320
I can't cover up for a Wufeng spy.

41:15.330 --> 41:15.820
I...

41:19.410 --> 41:20.810
You don't have to tell me.

41:24.180 --> 41:25.000
I understand.

41:34.720 --> 41:35.520
I understand.

41:54.780 --> 41:56.060
Will you believe me?

42:07.320 --> 42:08.980
Elder Yue once told me...

42:32.780 --> 42:34.020
What should I do?

42:34.860 --> 42:36.380
What should I do?

42:39.000 --> 42:39.800
You scared me.

42:40.260 --> 42:41.990
You called me here at midnight.

42:42.280 --> 42:43.610
You must be up to no good.

42:44.480 --> 42:45.620
It's dark and windy.

42:46.020 --> 42:47.280
A single man and woman.

42:47.800 --> 42:50.130
Of course I have something very important

42:50.620 --> 42:54.320
and that's why I took the risk of tainting my incense by looking for you at night.

42:54.320 --> 42:55.260
You mean tainting your innocence?

42:55.260 --> 42:56.440
They mean the same thing.

42:56.440 --> 42:57.370
What do you want?

42:57.510 --> 42:58.870
Go steal something with me.

42:58.870 --> 43:00.300
Are you going down the hill again?

43:00.300 --> 43:00.990
No.

43:01.580 --> 43:03.040
I have to sneak up the hill,

43:03.080 --> 43:04.080
then into the hill,

43:04.080 --> 43:04.950
and then out.

43:07.300 --> 43:08.310
Where do you want to sneak into it exactly?

43:08.310 --> 43:09.000
The Elders Hall.

43:09.000 --> 43:09.540
Goodbye.

43:09.610 --> 43:10.200
Stop!

43:11.080 --> 43:12.490
If you leave now,

43:12.670 --> 43:13.930
I'll expose you

43:14.170 --> 43:17.570
of developing all sorts of forbidden weapons and gunpowder.

43:18.110 --> 43:18.510
You...

43:21.060 --> 43:21.770
Listen.

43:23.680 --> 43:24.680
You will never...

43:37.590 --> 43:38.850
So what are we here to steal?

43:38.850 --> 43:41.450
The book of Gong Yuanzhi's poison and formula.

43:41.620 --> 43:42.210
I know.

43:42.710 --> 43:44.310
It must be in the Manifestation Pavilion.

43:44.310 --> 43:45.530
Once you enter the Elders Hall,

43:45.530 --> 43:46.750
you have to listen to me.

43:46.750 --> 43:47.810
I have experience.

43:49.580 --> 43:50.640
I can listen to you.

43:50.700 --> 43:51.350
But

43:51.790 --> 43:53.910
why do we have to move forward crouching?

43:53.910 --> 43:55.300
I told you read more books.

43:55.300 --> 43:56.300
The teacher said,

43:56.540 --> 44:00.400
people would walk towards new heights, and thieves steal from below.

44:04.410 --> 44:05.230
Brother Yue.

44:14.660 --> 44:15.320
Stop!

44:18.650 --> 44:20.110
Manifestation Pavilion.

44:22.350 --> 44:23.610
The herbs in the front hill

44:23.610 --> 44:25.210
are guarded by Gong Yuanzhi.

44:25.780 --> 44:28.130
Get the prescription and go to the Yue Lineage at the back

44:28.130 --> 44:30.190
and ask them to make medicine for you.

44:31.110 --> 44:32.020
I do.

44:41.240 --> 44:41.770
Let's go.

44:47.710 --> 44:50.290
[Hidden Weapon Poison Antidote Record]

44:50.020 --> 44:51.260
Hot potato.

44:58.270 --> 44:59.530
You've stolen it.

44:59.870 --> 45:00.670
I have to go back.

45:00.670 --> 45:01.470
When the sun rises.

45:01.470 --> 45:02.560
I'll be arrested and beaten up.

45:02.560 --> 45:03.040
No.

45:03.340 --> 45:04.670
You have to stay with me.

45:05.080 --> 45:06.320
You have to wait for him to come look for me.

45:06.320 --> 45:07.240
Who are we waiting for?

45:07.240 --> 45:08.370
I don't know either.

45:08.900 --> 45:11.550
Gong Ziyu, that bastard, he didn't finish his words.

45:11.550 --> 45:12.810
He said he would send someone to find me.

45:12.810 --> 45:13.440
Look.

45:13.750 --> 45:14.530
There's no one here.

45:14.530 --> 45:15.790
There's not even a ghost's shadow.

45:15.790 --> 45:17.050
Ahh!

45:17.350 --> 45:18.010
Who are you?

45:20.430 --> 45:21.900
Sword Wielder sent me here.

45:21.900 --> 45:23.900
To get the antidote from Eldest Young Miss.

45:23.900 --> 45:24.900
What's your name?

45:26.420 --> 45:27.110
I am nobody.

45:27.530 --> 45:29.330
My name is not worth mentioning.

45:39.340 --> 45:40.430
I have no antidote.

45:40.450 --> 45:41.450
Only the formula.

45:42.030 --> 45:45.160
These are four formulas corresponding to four poisons.

45:45.260 --> 45:46.500
You must find out

45:46.780 --> 45:48.940
what kind of hidden weapon Miss Yun was injured with,

45:48.940 --> 45:49.570
otherwise,

45:49.570 --> 45:51.630
we won't be able to treat it correctly.

45:51.630 --> 45:52.230
It's fine.

45:52.470 --> 45:53.520
I will make all four antidotes

45:53.520 --> 45:54.400
according to

45:54.420 --> 45:55.480
the prescription.

45:56.020 --> 45:57.820
Worst case scenario, she can just take it all.

45:57.820 --> 45:59.420
Where is the medical storage?

45:59.420 --> 46:00.110
I'll go now.

46:01.420 --> 46:02.020
You can't.

46:02.550 --> 46:03.850
The medical storage at the Gong family

46:03.850 --> 46:05.300
is managed by Gong Yuanzhi.

46:05.300 --> 46:06.560
He won't give it to you.

46:06.730 --> 46:07.910
What should we do then?

46:07.910 --> 46:08.690
Take this

46:08.870 --> 46:10.240
to the Yue Lineage at the back hill.

46:10.240 --> 46:11.300
They will help you.

46:11.840 --> 46:12.570
That's easy.

46:13.140 --> 46:14.990
What's easy?

46:15.600 --> 46:17.000
The back hill of Gong family

46:17.000 --> 46:19.060
is a forbidden place for the Gong family.

46:19.060 --> 46:21.270
Ordinary people can't enter it.

46:21.750 --> 46:22.870
Even I...

46:23.410 --> 46:25.550
the Eldest Young Miss

46:25.580 --> 46:26.980
can't enter.

46:27.260 --> 46:29.120
Let alone a nobody like you.

46:31.810 --> 46:32.340
Xiaohei.

46:33.070 --> 46:33.530
Xiao...

46:36.290 --> 46:36.830
Oh.

47:13.490 --> 47:14.090
Goodness.

47:14.140 --> 47:15.510
There's water in my eyes.

47:15.510 --> 47:16.770
I didn't see anything.

47:18.680 --> 47:20.000
There is a secret passage

47:20.000 --> 47:20.990
under the Ice Pool

47:20.990 --> 47:22.120
that leads outside?

47:22.190 --> 47:22.750
Smart.

47:23.470 --> 47:25.070
Have you found the antidote?

47:25.340 --> 47:26.140
I got it.

47:26.910 --> 47:27.860
But...

47:31.830 --> 47:35.730
[Qingfeng Dagger]
[Canglie Arrow]

47:35.970 --> 47:37.230
There are four poisons

47:37.310 --> 47:38.240
of Gong Yuanzhi.

47:38.930 --> 47:42.190
They are spread on different hidden weapons he often uses.

47:47.100 --> 47:48.170
[Hidden Weapon Poison Antidote Record]

47:47.440 --> 47:48.590
We need to first know

47:48.880 --> 47:50.590
what kind of hidden weapon Miss Yun was injured by.

47:50.590 --> 47:52.140
Didn't you extract the hidden weapon

47:52.140 --> 47:53.420
from Miss Yun?

47:53.780 --> 47:55.510
We'll know after we compare it.

47:57.880 --> 47:59.140
The hidden weapons at the Gong family

47:59.140 --> 48:01.670
are all made by the Hua Gongfu at the back hill.

48:02.100 --> 48:04.180
In particular, Gong Yuanzhi's hidden weapon

48:04.180 --> 48:05.580
are the most complicated.

48:05.580 --> 48:07.330
It will explode in various ways in the air

48:07.330 --> 48:09.110
according to the way he uses it.

48:09.950 --> 48:11.000
It's hard to tell

48:12.390 --> 48:15.590
which hidden weapon it is from the fragments themselves.

48:17.560 --> 48:18.620
Young Master Ziyu,

48:19.740 --> 48:21.720
can you show me the fragment?

48:30.860 --> 48:31.860
Give it to me.

48:32.260 --> 48:33.060
I'll go out

48:33.500 --> 48:35.030
to get the antidote for you.

48:40.690 --> 48:42.890
The hidden weapons used by Gong Yuanzhi

48:43.140 --> 48:44.510
are different from the Gong family hidden weapons

48:44.510 --> 48:45.850
that can be bought

48:46.110 --> 48:46.970
outside.

48:47.660 --> 48:48.980
They are more lethal.

48:50.200 --> 48:51.740
The structure is also exquisite.

48:51.740 --> 48:53.770
It's like an art of a craftsman.

49:12.050 --> 49:12.850
It's this one.

49:23.220 --> 49:24.080
No need to wait.

49:24.170 --> 49:25.010
Go get the explosives.

49:25.010 --> 49:26.340
Blow up this stone gate.

49:26.380 --> 49:26.800
Yes.

49:27.840 --> 49:28.680
Sorry.

49:31.500 --> 49:32.050
I forgot

49:32.130 --> 49:33.140
I have a spare key.

49:33.450 --> 49:35.160
I just got it from the old house.

49:35.160 --> 49:36.330
Young Master Yuanzhi,

49:36.330 --> 49:37.060
I apologize.

49:39.230 --> 49:39.960
Lead the way.

49:50.910 --> 49:52.170
Young Master Yuanzhi,

49:55.660 --> 49:57.040
What are you up to

49:58.930 --> 50:00.390
hiding in here for so long?

50:01.900 --> 50:03.130
It's just that there were

50:03.130 --> 50:04.230
two snow lotuses

50:04.330 --> 50:05.390
are about to bloom.

50:05.780 --> 50:07.110
So we waited for a while.

50:07.650 --> 50:09.790
Picking them after the bud has bloom

50:10.150 --> 50:11.680
will make them work better.

50:17.730 --> 50:18.930
You're not poisoned.

50:22.310 --> 50:23.260
What poison?

50:30.110 --> 50:31.660
I'm here to pick the snow lotus.

50:31.660 --> 50:34.060
Xue Chongzi and Young Master Xue know this.

50:34.710 --> 50:36.140
I'm not here to steal.

50:37.230 --> 50:38.560
How could I be poisoned?

50:49.100 --> 50:51.870
[Feng]

50:56.340 --> 50:57.600
Why did they invite us?

50:58.610 --> 50:59.960
I heard that Gong Shangjue

50:59.960 --> 51:02.020
suspected that Yun is a Wufeng spy.

51:02.810 --> 51:04.410
Even I was suspected before.

51:05.020 --> 51:06.240
So I was invited too.

51:09.350 --> 51:10.170
Elders.

51:11.110 --> 51:12.390
I've brought Miss Yun

51:12.390 --> 51:14.070
from the back hill's Snow Palace.

51:14.070 --> 51:15.000
As I said,

51:15.500 --> 51:16.170
Miss Yun

51:16.510 --> 51:18.550
was just asking Young Master Xue for a few

51:18.550 --> 51:19.750
Tianshan Snow Lotus.

51:20.100 --> 51:21.230
You're full of lies.

51:21.660 --> 51:22.710
Yun Weishan was injured by my hidden weapon

51:22.710 --> 51:23.780
in the Yu Lineage.

51:24.070 --> 51:25.960
That's why she escaped to the back hill.

51:25.960 --> 51:26.490
Really?

51:28.250 --> 51:30.290
I heard that the hidden weapon and poison of Yuanzhi

51:30.290 --> 51:31.530
are invincible.

51:32.430 --> 51:33.530
If Miss Yun

51:33.740 --> 51:35.790
was really injured by your hidden weapon,

51:35.790 --> 51:37.750
why can she still stand in front of you

51:37.750 --> 51:38.820
unscathed?

51:42.600 --> 51:43.530
Is it because...

51:43.920 --> 51:46.320
there's something wrong with your poison?

51:47.200 --> 51:48.400
It's easy to explain.

51:49.660 --> 51:51.320
Gong Ziyu gave his Herb Elixir

51:51.610 --> 51:52.870
to Yun Weishan.

51:53.730 --> 51:54.470
So,

51:54.850 --> 51:56.270
she's not affected by the poison.

51:56.270 --> 51:57.200
That's not true.

52:01.400 --> 52:02.930
Eldest Young Miss Zishang,

52:03.350 --> 52:04.360
why do you say so?

52:12.110 --> 52:13.770
You said that Miss Yun Weishan

52:13.810 --> 52:15.200
fought with you in the Yu Lineage.

52:15.200 --> 52:16.600
Only the two of you saw it.

52:17.530 --> 52:18.650
But I said Miss Yun

52:18.900 --> 52:20.470
went to the Xue Lineage to collect snow lotus.

52:20.470 --> 52:23.270
Both Young Master Xue and Xue Chongzi can testify.

52:23.670 --> 52:25.070
Their statements match.

52:26.060 --> 52:26.660
Looks like

52:27.360 --> 52:29.820
we can only ask the elders to make a decision.

52:31.520 --> 52:32.590
Words can be fake,

52:33.810 --> 52:35.010
but the wounds can't.

52:36.630 --> 52:39.020
The poison can be detoxified immediately.

52:39.020 --> 52:39.780
But the wound

52:40.660 --> 52:42.060
won't heal immediately.

52:43.870 --> 52:44.440
Yuanzhi.

52:45.830 --> 52:47.090
Where was Miss Yun Weishan

52:47.090 --> 52:48.750
injured by the hidden weapon?

52:50.350 --> 52:51.410
Her back shoulder.

52:53.790 --> 52:55.340
Could Miss Yun Weishan please

52:55.340 --> 52:56.520
let everyone check

52:56.750 --> 52:58.610
if there's a hidden weapon wound?

52:59.630 --> 53:00.320
Besides,

53:00.600 --> 53:02.060
Yuanzhi's hidden weapons

53:02.090 --> 53:04.650
were specially made by the Gong family for him.

53:04.650 --> 53:05.970
The wound is unique.

53:06.940 --> 53:08.470
It'd be obvious who's lying

53:09.190 --> 53:10.030
once we see it.

53:21.060 --> 53:22.590
Yun Weishan is my wife.

53:24.440 --> 53:26.120
Though we have not held the ceremony

53:26.120 --> 53:27.920
and are officially married yet,

53:28.620 --> 53:29.190
but

53:30.910 --> 53:31.890
in my heart,

53:33.620 --> 53:35.380
she's already my wife.

53:41.430 --> 53:42.940
How could you let her take off her clothes

53:42.940 --> 53:44.140
in front of so many people

53:44.140 --> 53:45.800
just for your one-sided words?

53:45.800 --> 53:46.930
How inappropriate!

53:47.940 --> 53:48.910
Of course I know

53:49.390 --> 53:51.590
a woman's innocence is very important.

53:52.100 --> 53:52.690
So,

53:53.320 --> 53:56.120
just ask the maid to take her to the side for a check.

53:56.830 --> 53:57.920
No need for a maid.

53:58.740 --> 53:59.410
Let me do it.

54:00.570 --> 54:01.200
Miss Yun.

54:01.910 --> 54:03.190
Please come with me.

54:05.570 --> 54:06.160
Wait.

54:08.260 --> 54:09.100
Lady Wuji

54:09.100 --> 54:11.630
was also suspected to be a Wufeng previously.

54:12.350 --> 54:13.570
To avoid suspicion,

54:16.830 --> 54:17.760
Shangguan Qian,

54:18.890 --> 54:19.850
you go ahead too.

54:22.830 --> 54:24.200
I know Ziyu

54:24.620 --> 54:26.350
doesn't like one-sided words.

54:26.830 --> 54:27.920
How does it sound

54:28.630 --> 54:29.960
to have the three of them

54:30.040 --> 54:31.370
testify for each other?

54:32.500 --> 54:33.110
Yes.

54:47.010 --> 54:48.340
If the Gong family knows

54:48.440 --> 54:50.290
they sent two people from Wufeng

54:50.310 --> 54:51.780
to check on if the other Wufeng

54:51.780 --> 54:53.110
is from Wufeng or not,

54:54.070 --> 54:56.070
it would be so embarrassing to them.

54:56.490 --> 54:57.220
Yun Weishan.

54:58.100 --> 54:58.920
You are lucky

54:59.660 --> 55:01.860
to have met me and Shangguan Qian today.

55:02.350 --> 55:04.220
Or else, you would've died.

55:06.230 --> 55:07.070
Thank you.

55:07.350 --> 55:08.210
Don't thank me.

55:10.430 --> 55:11.070
Here,

55:11.420 --> 55:12.620
with one more person,

55:12.740 --> 55:14.870
the chance of survival will be higher.

55:14.890 --> 55:15.790
Am I right?

55:17.490 --> 55:18.890
Pull yourself together.

55:18.960 --> 55:20.360
It's about time to go out.

55:22.090 --> 55:22.530
Wait.

55:24.740 --> 55:25.810
I can help you,

55:28.500 --> 55:29.760
but I have a condition.

55:35.030 --> 55:35.580
Go ahead.

55:37.700 --> 55:38.540
Tell me.

55:39.090 --> 55:42.490
How did you detoxify Gong Yuanzhi's hidden weapon's poison?

55:43.140 --> 55:45.910
I only got the structure of Gong Yuanzhi's hidden weapon.

55:45.910 --> 55:47.170
If I could know

55:47.340 --> 55:49.040
what poison the hidden weapon has

55:49.040 --> 55:50.640
and how can it be detoxified,

55:50.660 --> 55:52.030
then I won't have to suffer

55:52.030 --> 55:54.360
from the Fortnight FLies for a few months.

55:56.710 --> 55:58.750
Because Gong Ziyu gave me

55:59.690 --> 56:00.640
his Herb Elixir.

56:03.140 --> 56:04.110
That's all?

56:04.480 --> 56:05.510
That's all.

56:07.130 --> 56:09.330
Besides, Gong Shangjue has guessed it,

56:09.590 --> 56:10.300
no?

56:10.970 --> 56:13.570
Why did Gong Ziyu give you the Herb Elixir then?

56:16.310 --> 56:17.910
Why didn't he eat it himself?

56:19.150 --> 56:20.030
The first trial

56:20.050 --> 56:22.550
needed him to improve his inner skill in a short time.

56:22.550 --> 56:23.700
I must let him drink the poison

56:23.700 --> 56:25.360
to stimulate his inner skill.

56:27.040 --> 56:28.440
But with the Herb Elixir,

56:28.560 --> 56:29.820
the poison won't work.

56:31.060 --> 56:33.830
So he gave the Herb Elixir he didn't take for that period of time

56:33.830 --> 56:34.650
to me.

56:38.700 --> 56:39.750
You're so lucky.

56:42.860 --> 56:44.120
We're almost the same.

56:45.780 --> 56:46.840
In the Gong family,

56:48.280 --> 56:50.340
there will be a day your luck runs out.

56:52.550 --> 56:54.350
You two take care of yourselves.

57:09.730 --> 57:10.480
Elder,

57:11.300 --> 57:13.380
we just checked Miss Yun's back shoulder.

57:13.380 --> 57:16.840
- There was indeed nothing.
- Young Master Yuanzhi didn’t lie.

57:20.270 --> 57:21.810
On the back shoulder of Yun Weishan,

57:21.810 --> 57:24.140
there was an obvious hidden weapon wound.

57:24.500 --> 57:26.030
As for whether it is by Young Master Yuanzhi's

57:26.030 --> 57:27.440
hidden weapon,

57:28.050 --> 57:29.540
I can't tell it yet.

57:30.550 --> 57:32.210
I will have the elders decide.

57:35.610 --> 57:36.130
Guards!

57:36.720 --> 57:37.650
Lock Yun Weishan

57:37.940 --> 57:38.800
into the prison

57:39.350 --> 57:40.610
for Young Master Shangjue's interrogation!
